      "factId": "air-purifier-draft-001",
      "topicId": "air_purifier",
      "factText": "洁净空气量简称 CADR，表示设备输送过滤空气的速度；数值越高，过滤越快，可服务面积通常也越大。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-energy-star-air-cleaners"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "air-purifier-draft-002",
      "topicId": "air_purifier",
      "factText": "选择空气净化器要同时看房间面积和层高；同样面积下，层高增加通常需要更高的 CADR。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-energy-star-air-cleaners"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "air-purifier-draft-003",
      "topicId": "air_purifier",
      "factText": "摆放位置会影响实际性能，应给进出风口留出空间，并避开窗帘等可能阻挡气流的物体。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-energy-star-air-cleaners"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    }
